{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527710/extras/b33432859a3179e547edd37c87b87b7a.avif?t=1766680241\" width=1560 height=505 /></span><strong>TEXNOPLAZM</strong> is a first-person beat'em'up/shooter where <i>fists</i>, <i>melee weapons</i>, and <i>firearms</i> collide. <br>Rip weapons from enemies, switch combat styles on the fly, and chain movement with brutal takedowns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock powerful moves and passives as you tear through a gothic European cityscape \u2014 a future that never was.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast. Aggressive. Inventive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527710/extras/e7dc5515226cb27528a2790cfc0f1d63.avif?t=1766680241\" width=1560 height=81 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Fight</strong> enemies by wielding their own weapons against them</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Switch</strong> combat styles mid fight</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Blend</strong> movement and combat abilities for inventive takedowns</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock</strong> special moves and passive abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Explore</strong> the gothic cityscape of Europe, in a future that never was</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Uncover</strong> your mysterious origins</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527710/extras/487305a1e8ba2d8b0f4def5a54c0be74.avif?t=1766680241\" width=1560 height=81 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Year 200X, somewhere in Europe.</strong><br>In a world where advanced magic works like technology, extraordinary feats are attainable for those who possess the right sorcerer code.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nestled in the urban jungle, a street gang traffics synthetic companions known in the underground as \u201c<i>Dolls&quot;</i>. One of them<i>\u00a0</i>follows her routine...until the moment she does not. <br><br>Without any directive to guide her, she fights purely on instinct, a machine now unbound by purpose.<br><br><i>  </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She is the <i>Girl With No Name</i>, she is a <strong>Technoplasm</strong>.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2527710?t=1766680241","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2527710?t=1766680241","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527710/5b8ea3f0c8aeca7385f296eeca09dd3b4ab732ac/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766680241","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527710/5b8ea3f0c8aeca7385f296eeca09dd3b4ab732ac/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766680241","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"the game contains scenes of violence and gore that may not be suitable for all ages."},"demos":[{"appid":2757700,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527710/extras/b33432859a3179e547edd37c87b87b7a.avif?t=1766680241\" width=1560 height=505 /></span><strong>TEXNOPLAZM</strong> is a first-person beat'em'up/shooter where <i>fists</i>, <i>melee weapons</i>, and <i>firearms</i> collide. <br>Rip weapons from enemies, switch combat styles on the fly, and chain movement with brutal takedowns.</p><p 